# Pasting a date into the due date prompt types it there, as in any text field.
# BUG: text pasted into the terminal while the date prompt is open is dropped (keymap ignores Paste with an overlay open).
file <<END
- Renew passport
END
see Renew passport
keys md
see Due date
paste <<END
2026-12-24
END
see Thu 24 Dec 2026
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
- Renew passport @due(2026-12-24)
END
